WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:01,880
Don't hide

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:03,790
I just want to ask

3
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:08,060
How did you get the scar on your forehead from a fall?

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,460
Just dropped

5
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:11,340
I am very concerned about the scar on my forehead

6
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:13,560
care so much

7
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:16,380
Why don't you go to a plastic surgery hospital to get it removed?

8
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:18,820
This is not the scar I'm covering up

9
00:00:19,460 --> 00:00:20,860
I can't leave in this life

10
00:00:20,860 --> 00:00:24,920
A woman once said

11
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:28,660
The scar on her forehead will never be removed in her lifetime.

12
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,780
I didn’t keep Liu Boyer just to cover up the scar.

13
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,500
the person who said this

14
00:00:33,820 --> 00:00:37,740
Is she the one you love? No, I don’t love her.

15
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,610
and she loves me

16
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:41,130
Love to the core

17
00:00:41,490 --> 00:00:43,600
so she died

18
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,000
died miserably

19
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:47,830
If she knows you love her

20
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:50,730
I think she would be happy in another world

21
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,980
Her biggest wish in life

22
00:00:53,430 --> 00:00:54,790
Just to get your love
